00:14:25,714 --> 00:14:31,714
Aurora, a Portuguese migrant, works as an order picker
in a warehouse in Edinburgh, Scotland.

3
00:21:38,571 --> 00:21:44,571
Caught between the walls of a huge distribution centre and the solitude of her own room, Aurora tries to
seize every opportunity to resist the alienation and isolation that threaten her identity.

