01:12:08,571 --> 01:12:14,571
On Falling is a 2024 social realist drama film, written and
directed by Laura Carreira and starring Joana Santos.

11
01:19:21,428 --> 01:19:27,428
A British-Portuguese co-production, the film is Carreira's debut feature.

12
01:26:34,285 --> 01:26:40,285
The film explores themes of class, kitchen sink realism,
gig economy, gritty, british social realism.

13
01:33:47,142 --> 01:33:53,142
The tone is dark and emotional.
